cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Apsis: route-based AWS IAM escalation analysis and the Apsis console"
abstract: >-
  Apsis models an AWS account as a directed permission graph, enumerates the
  routes from low-privilege principals to administrator, and computes the minimum
  set of grants to revoke. Apsis is a static deep-space console for inspecting
  the recorded export.
authors:
